      "note": "RODE RODECaster Pro II datasheet (read as text 2026-11-12): length 305 mm x width 270 mm x height 60 mm, 1960 g, black or white; 4 x combo jack inputs (microphone, line, instrument), 2 x balanced line outputs, 4 x headphone outputs, 2 USB-C interfaces (USB 1: 2-in/16-out multichannel and 2-in/2-out mix-minus; USB 2), Bluetooth, microSD, Wi-Fi and Ethernet; power 30 W USB-C PD (15 V 2 A) from the supplied adaptor, so NO mains inlet and no power control. The datasheet does not say where the connectors are: the combos, line outputs, USB-C and Ethernet are placed on the rear face and the four headphone jacks on the front lip (GUESSES, no drawing read). Ethernet is modelled as rj45 / aoip like the other network ports; microSD, Bluetooth and Wi-Fi are not ports. The slab profile is an estimate (the sheet gives only the outer sizes): 60 mm at the rear, 48 mm at the front lip."
    },
    {
      "kind": "dealer",
      "url": "https://rode.com/en-us/microphones/interfaces-mixers/rodecaster-pro-ii",
